1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,645
Its signature effect is stem elongation.

2
00:00:03,645 --> 00:00:07,890
A cabbage grows as a flat rosette, with almost no stem.

3
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:13,580
Give it gibberellin, or the right season, and the stem suddenly shoots up and flowers.

4
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:14,830
That is bolting.

